  "scope": [
    "Adds only public-API test probes, builders, independent literal-session seeding, opt-in process harness, pinned fixture metadata and documentation. Core/four-product runtime, configuration and generated declarations/implementation are unchanged.",
    "Builds original Mosquitto2.1.2 archive without modifying1949 original files. Third-party implementation source is not a protocol algorithm reference; only public build/configuration/CLI/API interfaces are used. Broker/libmosquitto are not product dependencies.",
    "Real MQTT5/311 TCP/TLS with all three factories, binary65537-byte payloads, small37/41-byte read/write and13-byte chunks, QoS0/1/2 ACKs, subscribe/unsubscribe, outgoing aliases/NoLocal, retained deletion, abort Will, auth positive/negative, physical native retirement and retained message after all owners/Engine join.",
    "Literal Python CONNECTs independently confirm retained SessionPresent=1. Current client must fail closed with STATUS_SESSION. This exposes the remaining MQTT session recovery gap; it is not recovery or durable/reconnect qualification.",
    "Native Windows clients use WSL localhost forwarding to the same Linux broker. WSL Linux clients and broker are not native deployment qualification. Broker sockets are loopback-only; keys/passwords are temporary, never recorded or installed as services."
  ],
